> Irish crime thriller at its best, Stuart Neville is[ a] fantastic writer. Careful, this[ will] grab[ you and] not let[ go]. The Ghosts of Belfast[ is] the first in the Jack Lennon series but this is one of[ those series that] is loosley connected so[ reading] out of order[ is] not[ a problem].
